Package: kulan-fleet-admin
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: @PUBLISHER@ <@MAINTAINER_EMAIL@>
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Depends: python3 (>= 3.11), python3-gi, python3-gi-cairo, gir1.2-pango-1.0, gir1.2-gtk-4.0, gir1.2-adw-1 (>= 1.5), gir1.2-secret-1, openssl | whois
Recommends: kulan-desktop-settings
Homepage: @HOME_URL@
Description: @NAME@ fleet dashboard for administrators
 Kulan Fleet: see the computers that joined your organisation (Kulan OS
 version, compliance results, waiting updates, TPM unlock), make join codes
 and ask computers to report, install updates, turn compliance mode on,
 lock the screen, restart, switch off or go into lost mode. People: the
 accounts on the organisation's computers (add, roles, which computers,
 disable, remove), signed in to with a setup code and then their own
 password. Groups and policies (USB drives, apps), a weekly security report
 (saved as a PDF), admin-rights reviews and the activity log for auditors.
 Only accounts on the fleet's admin list see anything; not
 installed by default.
